WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:02.030
Sixteen eighty-eight.

2
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:05.370
A Catholic king, James
the Second, flees.

3
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.790
A group of leading Protestants
has invited William of Orange to

4
00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:09.990
England.

5
00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.630
Parliament offers the
crown to William and Mary,

6
00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:15.290
with almost no bloodshed in England.

7
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:18.330
Historians call it the
Glorious Revolution.

8
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:22.350
But who really won power: the
new monarchs, or Parliament?

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.910
And did it make England a democracy?

10
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.310
In this mission, you'll
meet the Bill of Rights,

11
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:31.022
