join in seventeen-oh-seven.

12
00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:32.730
You'll explore everyday life,

13
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:35.730
and question sources like a historian.

14
00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:39.350
Your mission: find out who
held real power after sixteen

15
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.820
eighty-eight.
